@ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170
@ApiKey = your-dev-key-here
# Set via: dotnet user-secrets set "ApiKeySettings:ApiKey" "your-dev-key-here" (see README).

### Health check (no API key required)
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List breweries (name, city, phone) - default paging
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Search + sort by name
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?search=dog&sortBy=name&sortDirection=asc&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Sort by city, descending
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=city&sortDirection=desc&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Sort by distance from a reference point (Denver, CO)
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=distance&latitude=39.7392&longitude=-104.9903&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Autocomplete search suggestions
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries/autocomplete?query=do&maxResults=10
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Error handling: distance sort without coordinates -> 400
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries?sortBy=distance
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Error handling: missing API key -> 401
GET {{ElfBeauty.BreweryApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/breweries
Accept: application/json
